a. conducting socialization regarding regulations and policies relating to violence against women for gampong apparatus, traditional leaders and religious leaders;
b. providing counseling to immediately report to local authorities if violence against women occurs;
c. forming a network in efforts to prevent violence; and d. other efforts deemed strategic to prevent violence against women.

